rName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":703598706,"text":"コホン…失敗は成功の母って言うだろ。もう昔の僕じゃないってことさ。","nextNodeIds":[735160105]},{"nodeId":735160105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3918860602,"text":"当時、一体どれだけ事故ったんだよ…まあ、とにかく実験は成功したんだからそれでいいよな！","nextNodeIds":[735160106]},{"nodeId":735160106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":3441380274,"text":"ああ、この勢いで、場所を変えてもう一度だ！","nextNodeIds":[735160107]},{"nodeId":735160107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":3005225362,"text":"——目撃情報によると、この辺りには少なくともまだ二桁のウェネトが潜んでいるからな！","nextNodeIds":[735160108]},{"nodeId":735160108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1591907474,"text":"ちょっと待った——二桁！？こんな調子で一匹ずつやっつけていくつもりじゃないよな？一体いつになったら終われるんだよ！","nextNodeIds":[735160109]},{"nodeId":735160109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":3193683938,"text":"えっ？何か問題があるかい？「対ウェネト殺蟲大砲」のメンテナンスなら、心配はいらないはずだけど…","nextNodeIds":[735160110]},{"nodeId":735160110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1785809714,"text":"いやいや！そんな終わりの見えないことをやってたら、たとえ機械が大丈夫でも、オイラたちのほうが先に持たなくなるぞ…","nextNodeIds":[735160111]},{"nodeId":735160111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":3073794386,"text":"ヴィナヤック、みんながあなたみたいに、エンジンオイルの匂いを嗅ぐだけで元気になれるわけじゃないのよ。","nextNodeIds":[735160112]},{"nodeId":735160112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":3840943434,"text":"そうか？じゃあ次はウェットウェアの機能についても検討しないとな…","nextNodeIds":[735160113]},{"nodeId":735160113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":2493736082,"text":"とにかく、今日はここまでにしましょう。今回とれた完全運行のデータと戦闘後のサンプルは、私が謎を解くための一歩を踏み出させてくれたわ。","nextNodeIds":[735160114]},{"nodeId":735160114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":597165746,"text":"謎って？","nextNodeIds":[735160115]},{"nodeId":735160115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":797116826,"text":"ウェネトが暴れ出す原因、環境パラメータの異常…こういったことたちを究明できれば、もしかしたら根本的に今回の騒ぎを解決できるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[735160116]},{"nodeId":735160116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":1537240738,"text":"あと一日、調査する時間をもらえないかしら。明日のこの頃には、結果が出てるはずだから。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7351601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30342"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7351601],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","count":5},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":3},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":1}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173516],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2975905358,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/V3.6SandSworm/Q7351601","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFF